Z||000000||Slapnutz2000||07-17-2001||04:32 AM||||I was cruising around today minding my own business when I see a cop behind me.  I go about my drive and he followed me for about 3-4 miles.  The cop pulls up next to me at a stoplight, rolls down his window, and says, "Hey kid!  Nice car!".<P>I swore I was going to get pulled over and given a ticket for something.  Mind you, I have a stock notchback that (kinda) needs a paint job so that guy must be a Fiero fan!<p>[This message has been edited by Slapnutz2000 (edited 07-17-2001).]||||reg||10
Z||000001||RossT||07-17-2001||04:40 AM||||At least he had good taste!!<P>More than likely he ran you plates thru the computer.......... nice to know that you don't have any outstanding tickets or warrants!!||||reg||1
Z||000002||rogergarrison||07-17-2001||09:01 AM||||I dont like them following me myself. If ones behind me for very long, Ill turn into a parking lot, station or something. Some of them seem to have a hatred for sports cars and follow you till you do something trivial they can bust you for.||||reg||1
