Z||000004||AusFiero||07-17-2001||10:54 AM||||I had 2 of them pull me over within 15 minutes once. First one asked me to do a breathaliser than got me to show him over the car cause he had never seen one. <P>Cop 2 was an American car fanatic and pulled me over, I thought oh no what have I done. He comes racing up to the window, Man a Fiero with t-tops can you open it all up for me to have a look.<P>Wish I had a blue light I could use to pull cars over I want to check out for the heck of it.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/fiero5.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A><BR>Need a Subwoofer Console or Speaker Door Pods?||||reg||1
