Z||000008||tomanyfieros||07-17-2001||12:33 PM||||some day, i am going to build a 4x4 fiero "cop car", i am going to take out the marker lights in the front bumper, and put blue and red strobe lights (made by street glow, they are the brightest!) and paint the car black, and that way, when i see a fiero, i can easily jump through the grass, pull them over annd talk... ;o) (talk to them, see if they need any parts, or if they are going to any shows... ect.) i think it will be fun,<BR>my brothers friend has a ford ranger (pos) and it is 4 wheel drive with a lift kit, he had blue and red strobes behind his grill, he pulled people over, ran up to there car, and when the people rolled there window down, he would laugh and say "got u!" and run back to the truck and drive away, he got caught on like the 13th car, he pulled over an off duty cop going somewhere like to a show or something, and when he yelled "got u!" the cop laughed, and he goes, ur coming with me. and he had a fine and spent like 2 days in jail for something like acting like a police or something like that, and his truck was impounded. i got a good laugh at that.... Jason<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/dreamer.gif">    <BR><B>We all have dreams, but not everyone gets them...</B>||||reg||1
